{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q55613679","formula":"C₄₈H₂₄","hill":"C48H24","elements":["H","C"],"composition":{"C":48.0,"H":24.0},"names":{"en":"Hexa-cata-hexabenzocoronene","ru":"Гекса-ката-гексабензокоронен"},"descriptions":{"en":"Hexa-cata-hexabenzocoronene (hexabenzo[a,d,g,j,m,p]coronene) is a polycyclic aromatic hydrocarbon with the molecular formula C48H24. It consists of a central coronene molecule, with an additional benzene ring fused onto each ring around the periphery. Hexa-cata-hexabenzocoronene has a contorted structure due to steric crowding among the benzene rings around the edge, analogous to the situation in benzo[c]phenanthrene.","ru":"Гекса-ката-гексабензокоронен (гексабензо[a,d,g,j,m,p]коронен) — химическое соединение из класса полициклических ароматических углеводородов с химической формулой C48H24. Не путать с просто гексабензокороненом имеющим систематическое название гекса-пери-гексабензокоронен. Представляет собой жёлто-оранжевое твёрдое вещество."},"fame":4,"pubchemCid":66107,"mass":600.7,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1=CC=C2C(=C1)C3=C4C5=C2C6=CC=CC=C6C7=C5C8=C(C9=CC=CC=C97)C1=CC=CC=C1C1=C8C4=C(C2=CC=CC=C23)C2=CC=CC=C21","inchikey":"XHJPOZDMDBETDO-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"tridecacyclo[34.6.6.02,7.08,41.09,14.015,40.016,21.022,39.023,28.029,38.030,35.037,42.043,48]octatetraconta-1(42),2,4,6,8(41),9,11,13,15(40),16,18,20,22(39),23,25,27,29(38),30,32,34,36,43,45,47-tetracosaene","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"66107","atoms":72,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":0.803,"y":-1.171,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.613,"y":-1.281,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":1.416,"y":0.11,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.416,"y":-0.11,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":0.613,"y":1.281,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.803,"y":1.171,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":1.601,"y":-2.336,"z":-0.001,"el":"C"},{"x":-